# Morrowind Temple: Tharer Rotheloth's "Galom Daeus" (TT_GalomDeus). Tharer Rotheloth gives the player the vampire
# hunters' implements and sends them against the elder vampire Raxle Berne in Galom Daeus (10); with him dead, Tharer
# Rotheloth rewards it (100) and has no more duties.
# PositionCell stands in for the travel, the console kill for the fight. Ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05:
# 0537C5DE Raxle Berne.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_crosier_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_galomdaeus_start
run
player->PositionCell 378 -280 3 0 "Molag Mar, Temple"
until 600 "tharer rotheloth"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tharer rotheloth
ask duties
ask Galom Daeus
expect GetJournalIndex TT_GalomDeus == 10
bye
end

case tt_galomdaeus_raxle
run
player->PositionCell 5746 4300 12811 0 "Galom Daeus, Observatory"
until 600 "raxle berne"->GetDistance player < 1500
wait 60
console 0537C5DE.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "raxle berne" >= 1
end

case tt_galomdaeus_done
run
player->PositionCell 378 -280 3 0 "Molag Mar, Temple"
until 600 "tharer rotheloth"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tharer rotheloth
ask Galom Daeus
expect GetJournalIndex TT_GalomDeus == 100
bye
end
